      "value": "The root cause / exploit with steps to reproduce has been found by the community.\n\nThis is disclosed privately via Security Exploit Report - [Ticket #724917](https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/724917) which was briefly also publicly disclosed there (now hidden or removed): https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/unban-bug\n\nMore information with steps to reproduce may be disclosed later once patched. Remind me if needed (tag me in the comments).",
