  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So, a user banned from a group I work for has been banned since the 17th of this month, then we noticed they were in our instance this morning. The first thing we thought was that they were unbanned, or it was an alt account. Turns out it's the same account, and the user was never unbanned and keeps coming back after the 1-hour wait from getting kicked. We have submitted a report to VRChat Trust and Safety regarding this issue.",
